FF\">0.92</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"root_cause\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"overbuy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"first_buy_vs_forecast_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.34</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"size_curve_mismatch_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"secondary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"late_first_markdown\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"planning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reduce_first_buy_cap_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"due\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-Q4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ops\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"advance_first_markdown_trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gap_ratio>=0.15\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"due\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-Q4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"carryover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"carry_units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"carry_cost_est\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>carryover</code> 字段把&quot;未清完的货&quot;显式带进下一季，是两个季度之间最容易被账务断掉的一环：若上季尾货不在下季的计划里出现，它就会变成&quot;突然冒出来的高账龄库存&quot;，重新触发一轮本可避免的降价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻环节的衔接\">与相邻环节的衔接</h2><p>预算的消耗与清仓进度之间存在时序错配：预算按季编制，而清仓进度按周跟踪。因此需要<strong>周度的预算-进度配对视图</strong>（见下图），任何一侧偏离都触发调整。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[周度: 预算消耗率] --&gt; C{与清仓进度率的差}&#10;  B[周度: 清仓进度率] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|消耗 &gt; 进度 + 10%| D[预算效率低&lt;br/&gt;收缩档位或改渠道]&#10;  C --&gt;|进度 &gt; 消耗 + 10%| E[效率高&lt;br/&gt;可释放额度]&#10;  C --&gt;|差在 10% 内| F[正常推进]&#10;  D --&gt; G[记录详情供季度复盘]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n  A[周度: 预算消耗率] --&gt; C{与清仓进度率的差}\n  B[周度: 清仓进度率] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|消耗 &gt; 进度 + 10%| D[预算效率低&lt;br/&gt;收缩档位或改渠道]\n  C --&gt;|进度 &gt; 消耗 + 10%| E[效率高&lt;br/&gt;可释放额度]\n  C --&gt;|差在 10% 内| F[正常推进]\n  D --&gt; G[记录详情供季度复盘]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>降价预算衡量的是<strong>被让渡的毛利总额</strong>（含蚕食损失），与促销预算（买增量销量）是两类不同的资源，混用会让复盘失去分辨力。</li>\n<li>清仓预算的规模由<strong>备货准确度</strong>决定；连续超支的根因通常在需求预测而非清仓技巧。</li>\n<li>预算分配按<strong>边际效率</strong>排序，且必须先声明目标是&quot;清件数&quot;还是&quot;回笼资金&quot;——两种导向给出相反的分配结果。</li>\n<li>品类预算宜采用&quot;总额硬约束 + 品类间可调剂&quot;，调剂需留理由；清仓进度会通过仓储与资金占用压缩下季的 open-to-buy，这个联动是采购与清仓冲突的根源。</li>\n<li>复盘的三问顺序是&quot;账对不对 → 问题在备货还是清仓 → 下一季改什么&quot;，且必须产出可执行改动。</li>\n<li><code>carryover</code> 字段把尾货显式带入下季，避免其以&quot;突然出现的高账龄库存&quot;形式重新触发降价。</li>\n<li>相关度量口径见 <a href=\"sellthrough-depth-margin-recovery\">售罄率/降价幅度/毛利回收</a>；备货侧的需求预测与补货属于相邻 hub，本 hub 只把它的准确度当作预算规模的解释变量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"降价预算与品类复盘","id":"降价预算与品类复盘"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"降价预算的编制","id":"降价预算的编制"},{"level":3,"text":"预算是什么，不是什么","id":"预算是什么-不是什么"},{"level":3,"text":"预算与备货计划的因果链","id":"预算与备货计划的因果链"},{"level":2,"text":"预算的分配","id":"预算的分配"},{"level":3,"text":"边际效率而非平均效率","id":"边际效率而非平均效率"},{"level":3,"text":"品类预算是硬约束还是软参考","id":"品类预算是硬约束还是软参考"},{"level":3,"text":"与 open-to-buy 的关系","id":"与-open-to-buy-的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"与 open-to-buy 的关系（对比视角）","id":"与-open-to-buy-的关系-对比视角"},{"level":2,"text":"品类复盘的流程与产出","id":"品类复盘的流程与产出"},{"level":3,"text":"复盘的三个问题","id":"复盘的三个问题"},{"level":3,"text":"复盘的产出物","id":"复盘的产出物"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻环节的衔接","id":"与相邻环节的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"售罄率/降价幅度/毛利回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-ops-metric/sellthrough-depth-margin-recovery"},"next":{"title":"与促销引擎/竞品价协同（边界032/103）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-ops-metric/promo-competitor-price-coordination"}}